# Define contribution schema v1 (IDEA-US-916)

## Goal
Create/validate JSON schema for the contribution payload used by this capability slot.

## Context
This task is part of `IDEA-US-916` and exists to support the Demo Addins bank for operator-visible add-in installs.

## Requirements
- Implement the change described below
- Keep changes generic (no provider-specific kernel logic)
- Add/adjust tests where appropriate

## Technical Approach
1. Locate the relevant module(s) in the repo
2. Implement the smallest viable change that satisfies the goal
3. Add tests and update docs if needed
4. Verify end-to-end with a demo add-in install/uninstall

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Change implemented and reviewed
- [ ] Unit/integration tests pass
- [ ] No regressions in add-in install/uninstall
